  Example:

  ```python
  x = tf.constant([5, 4, 6])
  y = tf.constant([5, 2, 5])
  tf.math.greater(x, y) ==> [False, True, True]

  x = tf.constant([5, 4, 6])
  y = tf.constant([5])
  tf.math.greater(x, y) ==> [False, False, True]
  ```

